        },
        {
          "text": " Basi sasa umrudishe mwanamke kwa mtu huyo, maana yeye ni nabii, naye atakuombea, upate kuishi. Bali usipomrudisha, fahamu ya kwamba kwa hakika utakufa wewe na watu wote ulio nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki akaamka asubuhi na mapema, akawaita watumwa wake wote, akawaambia maneno hayo yote, nao watu hao wakaogopa sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
